    title: "CfgBuilder decomposes a declaration whose initializer holds control flow (switch/match expression, lambda with a branch): the variable is recorded as a use and never defined, and a lambda's body is inlined into the enclosing function (java, ts, rust)"  # faf0
    status: todo_soft  # faf0
